# Draft A content pipeline working files (ADR-051). Unpublished and unconfirmed product data —
# treated like .env.local rather than like source. The four README.md files stay tracked so a
# fresh clone gets the folder structure; git will not descend into an ignored *directory*, which
# is why the contents are ignored rather than the directory itself. Recommendation pending owner
# confirmation — see docs/pipeline-prep/README.md.
/content-pipeline/*
!/content-pipeline/README.md
!/content-pipeline/drafts/
!/content-pipeline/completed/
!/content-pipeline/incoming/
/content-pipeline/drafts/*
!/content-pipeline/drafts/README.md
/content-pipeline/completed/*
!/content-pipeline/completed/README.md
/content-pipeline/incoming/*
!/content-pipeline/incoming/README.md
Latest.xlsx
